# Minimal mars validation: no device drivers, just the platform boots.
# It is merged after a device's own fragment, so it says nothing about what a device does want: leaving the
# drivers out is what this fragment is for. CONFIG_CPUFREQ in particular stays with the device (common_defconfig
# already leaves it off), because a device that asks for it -- mars does -- would have it switched off again here.
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_CPUFREQ is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_FOCALTECH is not set
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_BUTTONS is not set
# CONFIG_TOUCHSCREEN is not set
# CONFIG_UFS is not set
